<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ lang | default('en') }}">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
  <title>{% if title %}{{ title }} — {% endif %}{% if lang == 'cy' %}{{ site.name_cy }}{% else %}{{ site.name }}{% endif %}</title>
  {% if description %}<meta name="description" content="{{ description }}">{% endif %}
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="{{ site.url }}/en{{ page.url | replace('/en', '') | replace('/cy', '') }}">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="cy" href="{{ site.url }}/cy{{ page.url | replace('/en', '') | replace('/cy', '') }}">
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="{{ site.url }}/en{{ page.url | replace('/en', '') | replace('/cy', '') }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  {% include "partials/head-schema.njk" %}
  {% include "partials/faq-schema.njk" %}
  {% include "partials/video-schema.njk" %}
</head>
<body>
  <div class="draft-banner" role="status">
    {% if lang == "cy" %}
      Mae'r llyfrgell hon yn cael ei datblygu — gall drafftiau gynnwys gwallau. Wedi gweld rhywbeth o'i le? <a href="https://celticsource.online/Contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dywedwch wrthym</a>.
    {% else %}
      This library is in active development — drafts may contain errors. Spot something wrong? <a href="https://celticsource.online/Contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tell us</a>.
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% include "partials/header.njk" %}
  <div class="site-wrapper">
    {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <main>
      {{ content | safe }}
    </main>
  </div>
  {% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
  <aside class="community-footer">
    <div class="site-wrapper">
      {% if lang == "cy" %}
        <p class="community-footer__heading">Ymunwch â'r gymuned</p>
        <p>Mae Celtic Source yn brosiect cymunedol sy'n tyfu. Os ydych chi'n mwynhau'r cynnwys hwn, ymunwch â'n <a href="https://celticsource.online/join-the-community" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fforwm cymunedol</a>.</p>
      {% else %}
        <p class="community-footer__heading">Join the community</p>
        <p>Celtic Source is a growing community project. If you enjoy this content, join our <a href="https://celticsource.online/join-the-community" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">community forum</a>.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </aside>
</body>
</html>
